  "description": "THE FITNESS BICYCLE - Set Your Goals In Motion. BATCH #116 \"Made for making it, the Terry Hershey Trail, part of the Houston Greenway, is a popular route for the Houston community looking to get out there and reach some fitness goals. Suggested by an authorized dealer, this trail is a tidy 11.6 miles long, the perfect length to get out for regular cardio and calorie burns without completely emptying the tank. We can’t think of a better way to get to feeling good.\" It's time to get out and ride. Whether you're riding with friends or looking to add a little more exercise to your daily routine, the fitness bike can take you anywhere. With smooth, fast-rolling 700c tires and Shimano Tourney 21-speed shifting system, this bike is perfect for any ride. The range of gears makes the Fitness Bike a capable bike for getting up and down hilly terrain, through urban and rural settings alike. The flat handlebar offers an efficient, comfortable riding position for getting your heart pumping while getting out in the fresh air.",
